# Mnemosyne /anecdote schema — Cayley NQuads (LF only, no CRLF)
# Loaded by: Tools/SeedSchema.ts
# Foundation for structured anecdote capture + retrieval on top of Mnemosyne.
#
# Depends on: Mnemosyne pack's epistemology.nq + classifiers.nq.
# Seed Mnemosyne substrate FIRST, then this schema.
#
# Scope: capture and query only. Licensing, royalties, metering, and consumer
# billing — the "financial commons" of the upstream private stack — are NOT
# part of this prototype. Anecdotes here are simply graph-structured stories;
# any commercial layer is a future capability.

# ── Type: Anecdote ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
</anecdote/anecdote> </type/object/type> </type/type> .
</anecdote/anecdote> </type/object/name> "Anecdote" .
</anecdote/anecdote> </common/topic/description> "A discrete unit of case-based knowledge — typically a story carrying an underlying heuristic. The atomic unit of contribution." .

